{"2026.6.4:P03-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>氢化铝钠储氢晶胞</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.4 · 长郡保温卷一 · 原题5 · P03-Q05</div><h1>氢化铝钠储氢晶胞</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：利用晶胞几何与均摊法判断配位、距离、密度和水解放氢数量。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/阿伏加德罗常数</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>5. 氢化铝钠(<img src=\"chem-asset:33cc218fa15c92b4d98876bba953d971d8bc28d1f6fb28d14a4c1fe22ce22c89:0;\" style=\"width:50.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)是一种新型轻质储氢材料，它可由<img src=\"chem-asset:93cb4fab2964b13ca266ecf4f6793e0a6c0bfbea6ad5c168433941e1c294a1a4:1;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:4c69aa3733ec5b297a05af77a7ee88bfdb68b2cffeb10f97aeead35384596ae6:2;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">在适当条件下合成，<img src=\"chem-asset:33cc218fa15c92b4d98876bba953d971d8bc28d1f6fb28d14a4c1fe22ce22c89:0;\" style=\"width:50.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的晶胞结构如图所示，它是由两个正六面体叠加而成。设<img src=\"chem-asset:d8b68a9d309cf7689d828e2e60d480c3af323d5b1a71bf42f66a9f8d5efced79:3;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阿伏加德罗常数的值，下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:fe52c5f141bffad2888604bfcf9cb10a3365e0e8d9009506b563ad5e1ec92db4:4;\" style=\"width:244.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 每个<img src=\"chem-asset:f54efbab7e1a498df4ec66f78c6d271960ef5654b54b52b1ec14fafc2e689611:5;\" style=\"width:54.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">周围等距离且最近的<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">有6个</p><p>B. <img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">间的最近距离为<img src=\"chem-asset:deb482b1dc326deef220b3cd88e6fea4347248c47ff1004a5632aaa3e43c0971:7;\" style=\"width:61.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:6df9a863f84b9cd63a89a216f53861d82d9a8a74465dce834547f779164b8396:8;\" style=\"width:91.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与足量水反应，生成<img src=\"chem-asset:1539f1d6cd8a5bd41ade26918a3f5fa1ee897392443d33f8705bdfdffdd87cd3:9;\" style=\"width:64.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(标准状况下)</p><p>D. 晶体的密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:469269ba13684c3f393c83ff9e535b6f53ae121a90b6a1a4d85d8ce8951d9afc:10;\" style=\"width:118.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．每个<img src=\"chem-asset:f54efbab7e1a498df4ec66f78c6d271960ef5654b54b52b1ec14fafc2e689611:5;\" style=\"width:54.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">周围最近的<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">有8个(以体心的<img src=\"chem-asset:f54efbab7e1a498df4ec66f78c6d271960ef5654b54b52b1ec14fafc2e689611:5;\" style=\"width:54.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为参考，<img src=\"chem-asset:d7a6f67df3114325d78bc88b3dbc41028147b633d62fd40658bc57542b92b3b7:11;\" style=\"width:80.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)，A错误；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">间的最近距离为面对角线的一半，即<img src=\"chem-asset:deb482b1dc326deef220b3cd88e6fea4347248c47ff1004a5632aaa3e43c0971:7;\" style=\"width:61.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:7dc975c69cc5d4e7e7b4b672c4bfa37d165ab931c4082f4a630403dae319327e:12;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与水反应方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:82f781243e55b441284d670387a15d869b5d8d97993ac5d3e7023a0b797b879d:13;\" style=\"width:269.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:6ae380ff4eb47d19effee5021358d7e39b6d10a6f39c6ea1c5c8ab69b1ea2b18:14;\" style=\"width:95.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">会生成<img src=\"chem-asset:b25f45e8dccf574ffab6b24f7bf534d7874520d15abe03cf62bb0e8feb3ec958:15;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氢气，体积在标准状况下为<img src=\"chem-asset:86ecea5ee5c13d28cc8df1bd93c4bfc45c1f28e1c9dcd934ea33e44c31dd1443:16;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．晶胞参数为<img src=\"chem-asset:162e264365070d14639a3feefb241f075b564ff2b7a6d37626aaa3eac927dd8b:17;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:5ec8d827dbaca1a75c8a97c1d34d9ede06dca478e42aeada4888833e109cf36a:18;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，因此晶胞体积<img src=\"chem-asset:22e4dfa48969c0b251f18189df7a43abf87cb8c84c13833924253b5b56955720:19;\" style=\"width:194.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，晶胞中<img src=\"chem-asset:f54efbab7e1a498df4ec66f78c6d271960ef5654b54b52b1ec14fafc2e689611:5;\" style=\"width:54.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">数目为<img src=\"chem-asset:abecb9049d11b1e3236406d0189f6f5a7ebd84bc175055652baab4beb922e660:20;\" style=\"width:123.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:6;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">数目为<img src=\"chem-asset:cbb6204f7554f503b28b851a77e27fe72b012468308bbb7fa8e82d9bd2a2b176:21;\" style=\"width:105.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，晶体的密度<img src=\"chem-asset:2173aab3507e88c994960467a6b2017cd482a3f20ee0cab8f1cce55946c97f06:22;\" style=\"width:297.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>故选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期保温卷（一）化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期保温卷（一）化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E6%B8%A9%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E6%B8%A9%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["1539f1d6cd8a5bd41ade26918a3f5fa1ee897392443d33f8705bdfdffdd87cd3","162e264365070d14639a3feefb241f075b564ff2b7a6d37626aaa3eac927dd8b","2173aab3507e88c994960467a6b2017cd482a3f20ee0cab8f1cce55946c97f06","22e4dfa48969c0b251f18189df7a43abf87cb8c84c13833924253b5b56955720","33cc218fa15c92b4d98876bba953d971d8bc28d1f6fb28d14a4c1fe22ce22c89","469269ba13684c3f393c83ff9e535b6f53ae121a90b6a1a4d85d8ce8951d9afc","4c69aa3733ec5b297a05af77a7ee88bfdb68b2cffeb10f97aeead35384596ae6","5ec8d827dbaca1a75c8a97c1d34d9ede06dca478e42aeada4888833e109cf36a","5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e","6ae380ff4eb47d19effee5021358d7e39b6d10a6f39c6ea1c5c8ab69b1ea2b18","6df9a863f84b9cd63a89a216f53861d82d9a8a74465dce834547f779164b8396","7dc975c69cc5d4e7e7b4b672c4bfa37d165ab931c4082f4a630403dae319327e","82f781243e55b441284d670387a15d869b5d8d97993ac5d3e7023a0b797b879d","86ecea5ee5c13d28cc8df1bd93c4bfc45c1f28e1c9dcd934ea33e44c31dd1443","93cb4fab2964b13ca266ecf4f6793e0a6c0bfbea6ad5c168433941e1c294a1a4","abecb9049d11b1e3236406d0189f6f5a7ebd84bc175055652baab4beb922e660","b25f45e8dccf574ffab6b24f7bf534d7874520d15abe03cf62bb0e8feb3ec958","cbb6204f7554f503b28b851a77e27fe72b012468308bbb7fa8e82d9bd2a2b176","d7a6f67df3114325d78bc88b3dbc41028147b633d62fd40658bc57542b92b3b7","d8b68a9d309cf7689d828e2e60d480c3af323d5b1a71bf42f66a9f8d5efced79","deb482b1dc326deef220b3cd88e6fea4347248c47ff1004a5632aaa3e43c0971","f54efbab7e1a498df4ec66f78c6d271960ef5654b54b52b1ec14fafc2e689611","fe52c5f141bffad2888604bfcf9cb10a3365e0e8d9009506b563ad5e1ec92db4"],"sourceSha256":"ce50ee8c297a069947dd79bb2cf3c7dda613e7c438e28fee1b9d5d0d702f628f"},"2026.6.4:P05-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铜催化炔烃合成循环</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.4 · 雅礼三模 · 原题13 · P05-Q13</div><h1>铜催化炔烃合成循环</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能/基元反应与反应历程</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：由催化循环的价态与原子守恒识别自由基及总反应。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃/炔烃</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/电离能 电负性</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量:H~1  N~14    O~16    Cl~35.5   Ni~59   Cu~64    In~115</p><p>13.一种在铜催化剂作用下合成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a-C</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>炔烃的过程示意图如下。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:02826ce7a71e865f0aa6142d8d4971886c299611af0a04e5fca1c2e08fd66ed9:0;\" style=\"width:433.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>已知：C和 Br的电负性分别为2.5 和2.8；图中“·”表示未成对电子，Ⅰ、Ⅱ表示铜元素的价态。下列说法不正确的是</p><p>A.-CF<sub>3</sub>减弱了<img src=\"chem-asset:71f1ef2d19c26bf768d8b1ca3a4f2a6b3c4c32c73b86be57a1b45d12eba04005:1;\" style=\"width:90.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中C—Br的极性</p><p>B.过程②中得到的M为·Br</p><p>C.反应欲制得 1mol a-CF<sub>3</sub>炔烃,投入Cu<sup>I</sup>LₙBr的物质的量无需 1mol</p><p>D.合成α-CF<sub>3</sub>炔烃的总反应：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:53d2231de6defcc1cfe1bd5a8c4757451741334a2c74b9cc55c0defc9908a023:2;\" style=\"width:371.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>原答案：B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><figure><img src=\"chem-asset:29802047d6a64be459fc79dd5dbdc7e685945208e935516444ff6cf7f2bd60b1:3;\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;margin:0\" alt=\"原答案PDF第2页对应题目内容\"></figure></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三下学期考前学情自测 化学试题\\雅礼中学高三模拟卷(三)化学试卷.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E8%87%AA%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%28%E4%B8%89%29%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7.docx\">打开原来源文件</a><p>原答案与解析PDF：<a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E8%87%AA%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%28%E4%B8%89%29%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88.pdf\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三下学期考前学情自测 化学试题\\雅礼中学高三模拟卷(三)化学答案.pdf</a></p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["02826ce7a71e865f0aa6142d8d4971886c299611af0a04e5fca1c2e08fd66ed9","29802047d6a64be459fc79dd5dbdc7e685945208e935516444ff6cf7f2bd60b1","53d2231de6defcc1cfe1bd5a8c4757451741334a2c74b9cc55c0defc9908a023","71f1ef2d19c26bf768d8b1ca3a4f2a6b3c4c32c73b86be57a1b45d12eba04005"],"sourceSha256":"779892fa18888c94c5d87295d9e0338534de4788bb2495f4f29d1e8ca46e6b07"}}